  "agent": "Vanguard Properties, Inc.",
  "text": "Modern architecture, beautiful scale and effortless indoor-outdoor living come together at 200 Putnam, a recently remodeled Bernal Heights home just two blocks from the restaurants, cafs and shops of Cortland Avenue. From the moment you step inside, the home feels special. Soaring ceilings and walls of windows flood the main living space with natural light, while newly installed wide-plank engineered white oak hardwood floors add warmth and a polished, contemporary feel throughout. The open living, dining and kitchen spaces flow together beautifully equally suited to a quiet morning coffee, an intimate dinner or a house full of friends. Open the doors to the rear patio and let dinner spill outside for grilling and cocktails on a warm Bernal evening. Thoughtfully arranged across multiple levels, the home offers the rare luxury of both openness and separation. Four bedrooms create flexibility for family, overnight guests or a dedicated home office, while the upper-level lounge feels like a retreat of its own curl up with a book, put on a movie or simply settle in and unwind at the end of the day. And then there's the roof deck. Perched above it all with open southern outlooks, it may quickly become your feature of the house. Gather around the firepit with a glass of wine as the sun goes down, host friends for an evening under the stars, or steal a quiet moment above the city with your morning coffee. Multiple outdoor spaces make the home feel even more expansive, while an attached two-car garage, generous storage and dedicated laundry add the everyday conveniences that make city living easy. Outside your door, some of Bernal's best neighborhood spots are just a couple of blocks away along Cortland Avenue, with the Tompkins Stairway Garden, neighborhood parks and Alemany Farmers' Market nearby. And when it's time to leave the neighborhood, easy access to 101 and 280 makes commuting downtown or heading south remarkably convenient. Freshly remodeled yet warm and inviting, 200 Putnam delivers the space, style and outdoor living of a modern luxury home with the charm and energy that make Bernal Heights such a beloved San Francisco neighborhood.",
