  "agent": "Laurel Realty & Investment",
  "text": "One-of-a-Kind Custom Home! A truly unique opportunity to own a one-of-a-kind custom-built residence in San Francisco's desirable Bernal Heights neighborhood. Thoughtfully designed with distinctive architectural details, generous living spaces, and a contemporary floor plan, 75 Bronte Street offers the character and individuality rarely found in today's market. This custom residence was created with an emphasis on modern living, natural light, indoor-outdoor flow, and flexible spaces that can accommodate a variety of lifestyles. From its custom design and finishes to its exceptional use of space, this is a property that stands apart from typical San Francisco homes. Important Disclosure: Certain building permits and/or final inspections associated with the construction remain open and must be completed and finalized with the appropriate City of San Francisco departments in order to obtain the final Certificate of Occupancy/Completion. Buyer is encouraged to independently investigate the permit history, current status of all permits, outstanding requirements, and the process and costs necessary to obtain final approvals to their satisfaction. A rare opportunity for a buyer seeking a distinctive custom San Francisco residence with the ability to complete the final permitting process and make this exceptional property their own.",
