  "text": "How often does a warm and inviting home featuring 4-bedrooms AND 4.5-baths come onto the market in San Francisco? What about a wonderfully well-kept home that offers THREE en suites, plus a separate 1-bedroom, 1-bath bonus living area downstairs? Exactly. It's a rarity! This thoughtfully designed home includes an abundance of extras: attractive kitchen and bathroom updates, cozy gas fireplace, a family entertainment room with multipurpose bar, central vacuum system, and upscale Valet Custom Cabinet built-ins throughout. You'll love the light that streams in through the San Francisco Shutters stylishly dressed windows, illuminating the upstairs with its radiant glow. Speaking of energy, elevate your outdoor entertainment repertoire and invite guests to spill out from the kitchen and dining rooms onto the spacious rear deck and down to the beautifully landscaped yard enhanced by its water feature and high-end year-round turf. The nice, finished garage offers even more room to expand with its epoxy floors and generous bank of custom cabinets, workbench, and filing cabinets designed to house all of your personal and business supplies, hobby and workout gear. Still on the fence? Consider Bernal Height's countless \"location, location\" advantages! Tenant occupied. Please do not disturb.",
