  "text": "Located on a prominent corner lot of the vibrant Excelsior neighborhood, 1 Edinburgh Street makes a striking first impression with crisp, freshly painted exterior, a graceful landscaped front garden and undeniable curb appeal. This elegantly updated home unfolds across a versatile dual-level layout featuring two bedrooms and one bath on the main level and a versatile in-law space on the lower level. Walking up to the main home, you are greeted with a mosaic tile stairwell. The main level serves as a sophisticated backdrop for daily life, where beautiful hardwood floors add a layer of warmth and timeless character to the living spaces. The sun-drenched living room anchored by a classic brick fireplace, fills the space with natural light and offers an inviting ambiance. It flows naturally into a formal dining room that is perfectly suited for hosting. The heart of the home is the thoughtfully remodeled kitchen, which balances modern style with everyday functionality overlooking Mt. Davidson and Sutro Tower. It boasts sleek quartz countertops and backsplash, stainless steel appliances including new dishwasher, custom shaker cabinetry, and open shelving. Every detail is designed to inspire culinary creativity. This main level features two spacious bedrooms complemented by an updated bathroom that offer a refined, contemporary feel. Adding to the property's unique appeal is a lower level with its own separate entrance, providing exceptional flexibility. This space features a comfortable living area, a full bathroom, and a remarkably spacious kitchen, making it ideal for a dedicated home office, guest quarters, or a creative studio. The home features a tankless water heater, 1-car garage parking, and a private and inviting backyard. The location is a standout for anyone seeking a vibrant, connected lifestyle. You are just moments away from local shops, bakeries, and essential transit options, including the BART station and easy freeway access for a seamless commute. For those who love the outdoors, the expansive McLaren Park is nearby, offering a wealth of recreation options from scenic trails and tennis courts to the Jerry Garcia Amphitheatre. Combining a fresh, move-in-ready interior with an adaptable floor plan, this residence is a rare find in a truly dynamic neighborhood.",
